<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>The impact of randomly selecting instruction tuning data with different ratios for training on the performance of the large multi-modal model. Comparing to the old mllm models, current popular mllm model, i.e. InternVL3-Instruct-8B <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhu et al. (2025)</a></cite> already achieves very high performance in Q-bench.</figcaption>
